    "text": "If the function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable columnspacing=\"1.4ex\" columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>k</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is continuous at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to:"
