  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\" columnspacing=\"1.4ex\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>k</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math></p><p>Taking L.H.S<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn></mrow><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now equating with R.H.S we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
